{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263ngvOZSiz21793185955.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西班牙高速鐵路列車相撞，據報造成50人死亡、179人受傷，車上有4名中國公民，當中有人受傷。</p><p></p><p>西班牙媒體報道，當地周三上午，首都馬德里與安達盧西亞之間的高速鐵路有兩架列車相撞，據報有列車可能追撞另一架列車，導致車廂脫軌。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SPA.TRAIN-1830.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ce0RCQpvTv1793186088.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>消息指，事故可能是人為失誤造成，控制中心的操作人員向後一架列車發出允許繼續行駛的指令。西班牙首相桑切斯在社交平台發文對列車相撞事故深感震驚，並向所有遇難者家屬表示慰問和支持。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:21:42.435401+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T13:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T13:58:15.657597+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:18:22.677516+00:00","content_hash":"2d176d2ab506f50ffdb0b4a310bfaa42f5fc6a59ff8d5d90918409db85aa78e7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:21:42.435401+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}